      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pancreatitis can be a rare but serious side-effect of Mirtazapine. There are very few case reports worldwide that highlight this. We present a case of recurrent pancreatitis which demonstrates this potential clinical association."},
